#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python3.xml:177
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Python 3"
msgstr "Instalação do Python 3"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python3.xml:180
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Python 3</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>Python 3</application>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python3.xml:184
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr          \\\n"
"            --enable-shared        \\\n"
"            --with-system-expat    \\\n"
"            --enable-optimizations \\\n"
"            --without-static-libpython &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr          \\\n"
"            --enable-shared        \\\n"
"            --with-system-expat    \\\n"
"            --enable-optimizations \\\n"
"            --without-static-libpython &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python3.xml:192
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Some tests are known to occasionally hang indefinitely.  So to test the "
"results, run the test suite but set a 2-minute time limit for each test "
"case:"
msgstr ""
"Alguns testes são conhecidos por travarem ocasional e indefinidamente. "
"Portanto, para testar os resultados, execute a suíte de teste, porém "
"configure um limite de tempo de 2 minutos para cada caso de teste:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python3.xml:197
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make test TESTOPTS=\"--timeout 120\"</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make test TESTOPTS=\"--timeout 120\"</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python3.xml:238
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"For a relatively slow system you may need to increase the time limit and 1 "
"SBU (measured when building Binutils pass 1 with one CPU core) should be "
"enough.  Some tests are flaky, so the test suite will automatically re-run "
"failed tests.  If a test failed but then passed when re-run, it should be "
"considered as passed."
msgstr ""
"Para um sistema relativamente lento, você possivelmente precise aumentar o "
"limite de tempo e 1 UPC (medido ao construir Binutils  a passagem 1 com um "
"núcleo de CPU) deveria ser suficiente. Alguns testes são instáveis, de forma"
" que a suíte de teste automaticamente reexecutará testes falhos. Se um teste"
" falhou, porém a seguir passou quando reexecutado, ele deveria ser "
"considerado como passado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python3.xml:246
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Of over 44,000 tests, the following tests are known to fail: test_idle, "
"test_importlib, test_tkinter, and test_zipfile."
msgstr ""
"De mais de 44.000 testes, os seguintes são conhecidos por falharem: "
"test_idle, test_importlib, test_tkinter e test_zipfile."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python3.xml:251
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python3.xml:254
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python3.xml:257
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If upgrading and the documentation has been downloaded, optionally install "
"it as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Se atualizar e a documentação tiver sido baixada, [então] opcionalmente "
"instale-a como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;&root;&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python3.xml:261
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -dm755 /usr/share/doc/python-&python3-version;/html\n"
"\n"
"tar --strip-components=1  \\\n"
"    --no-same-owner       \\\n"
"    --no-same-permissions \\\n"
"    -C /usr/share/doc/python-&python3-version;/html \\\n"
"    -xvf ../python-&python3-version;-docs-html.tar.bz2</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -dm755 /usr/share/doc/python-&python3-version;/html\n"
"\n"
"tar --strip-components=1 \\\n"
"    --no-same-owner       \\\n"
"    --no-same-permissions \\\n"
"    -C /usr/share/doc/python-&python3-version;/html \\\n"
"    -xvf ../python-&python3-version;-docs-html.tar.bz2</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python3.xml:272
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python3.xml:275
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command> CXX=\"/usr/bin/g++\" ./configure ...</command>: Avoid an annoying "
"message during configuration."
msgstr ""
"<command> CXX=\"/usr/bin/g++\" ./configure ...</command>: Evite uma mensagem"
" irritante durante a configuração."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python3.xml:280
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-system-expat</parameter>: This switch enables linking "
"against the system version of <application>Expat</application>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-system-expat</parameter>: Essa chave habilita vinculação à"
" versão do sistema do <application>Expat</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python3.xml:294
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-optimizations</parameter>: This switch enables stable, "
"but expensive, optimizations."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-optimizations</parameter>: Essa chave habilita "
"otimizações estáveis, mas caras."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python3.xml:299
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--with-lto</option>: This optional switch enables thick Link Time "
"Optimization. Unusually, it creates a much larger <filename "
"class=\"libraryfile\">/usr/lib/python&python3-majorver;/config-&python3-majorver;-&lt;arch&gt;-linux-"
"gnu/libpython&python3-majorver;.a</filename> with a small increase in the "
"time to compile <application>Python</application>. Run-time results do not "
"appear to show any benefit from doing this."
msgstr ""
"<option>--with-lto</option>: Essa chave opcional habilita &quot;Link Time "
"Optimization&quot; denso. Excepcionalmente, ele cria um &quot;<filename "
"class=\"libraryfile\">/usr/lib/python&python3-majorver;/config-&python3-majorver;-&lt;arch&gt;-linux-"
"gnu/libpython&python3-majorver;.a</filename>&quot; muito maior com um "
"pequeno aumento no tempo para compilar o "
"&quot;<application>Python</application>&quot;. Os resultados em tempo de "
"execução não parecem mostrar nenhum benefício advindo de fazer isso."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python3.xml:310
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring Python 3"
msgstr "Configurando o Python 3"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python3.xml:313
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"In order for <command>python3</command> to find the installed documentation,"
" create the following version independent symlink:"
msgstr ""
"Para a finalidade de que &quot;<command>python3</command>&quot; encontre a "
"documentação instalada, crie o seguinte link simbólico independente da "
"versão:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python3.xml:317
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>ln -svfn python-&python3-version; "
"/usr/share/doc/python-3</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>ln -svfn python-&python3-version; "
"/usr/share/doc/python-3</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python3.xml:320
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"and add the following environment variable to the individual user's or "
"system's profile:"
msgstr ""
"e adicione a seguinte variável de ambiente ao perfil individual do(a) "
"usuário(a) ou ao do sistema:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python3.xml:324
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>export PYTHONDOCS=/usr/share/doc/python-3/html</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>export PYTHONDOCS=/usr/share/doc/python-3/html</userinput>"

